     Specify the position of secondary subtitles on the screen. This is similar
     to ``--sub-pos`` but for secondary subtitles.

+``--sub-bottom-stacking=<yes|no>``
+    Stack secondary subtitles with primary subtitles at the bottom of the
+    screen instead of the top of the screen. When enabled, both primary and
+    secondary subtitles will appear near the bottom of the screen, with
+    secondary positioned above the primary subtitle.
+
